Package: rpkgfix  
Title: Diagnose and Fix Common R Package Problems  
Version: 0.1.0  
Authors@R: 
    person("Lawrence", "Garba", email = "laws.garba@gmail.com",  
           role = c("aut", "cre"))  
Description: A dependency-light developer toolkit that diagnoses and fixes the  
    most repetitive and error-prone problems in R package development. Provides  
    read-only checks for DESCRIPTION hygiene, license consistency, import  
    coverage, documentation gaps, NAMESPACE drift, undefined globals, non-ASCII  
    characters, style anti-patterns, example runnability, test coverage,  
    spelling, console output, side effects, dependency weight, and NEWS  
    consistency, plus mutating helpers that repair them.  
License: MIT + file LICENSE  
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)  
Imports: 
    tools,  
    utils,  
    stats  
Suggests: 
    devtools,  
    codetools,  
    withr,  
    knitr,  
    rmarkdown,  
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)  
Config/testthat/edition: 3  
